==== J. build your own ====
stylised takeaway: Your pathway reaches 699 ppm and +4.0 °C by 2150. Fossil emissions never stop on this pathway — they hold at today's 10.5 GtC a year all the way to 2150 — so carbon keeps being added to what is already up there. Carbon emissions have to drop to near zero for concentrations to stay stable. 
